<title>UK: Eurotunnel London news conference set Monday.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel London news conference set Monday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotunnel Plc said on Friday it would hold a news conference in London on Monday at 1000 GMT to present its financial restructuring plan.</p>
<p>No statement will be issued before the news conference, a Eurotunnel spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
